1
00:00:03,053 --> 00:00:05,083
(Sheldon:)What a wonderful day, thank you.

2
00:00:05,087 --> 00:00:06,517
(Penny:)Oh, we're glad
you had fun.

3
00:00:06,522 --> 00:00:09,022
(Sheldon:)Blue Icees and a trip
to The Container Store?

4
00:00:09,024 --> 00:00:11,654
(Sheldon:)It's like I died and went
to the post-mortem,

5
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:16,060
(Sheldon:)neuron-induced hallucination
commonly mistaken as heaven.

6
00:00:16,065 --> 00:00:18,165
(Leonard:)I still don't understand
why you bought that pill caddie.

7
00:00:18,167 --> 00:00:19,337
(Leonard:)You're a young man.

8
00:00:19,335 --> 00:00:21,735
(Sheldon:)Age is a state of
mind, Leonard.

9
00:00:21,737 --> 00:00:23,807
(Sheldon:)In here I'm 90.

10
00:00:26,275 --> 00:00:29,205
(Sheldon:)Why are you taking
your bins over there?

11
00:00:29,211 --> 00:00:30,711
That's just where
I need them.

12
00:00:30,713 --> 00:00:32,713
(Leonard:)You know, she doesn't have
a lot of closet space.

13
00:00:32,715 --> 00:00:34,745
(Sheldon:)What's wrong with your closet?

14
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:36,280
(Penny:)Uh...

15
00:00:36,285 --> 00:00:38,015
(Penny:)Well, honey, you know,

16
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:39,590
(Penny:)now that Leonard and I
are married,

17
00:00:39,588 --> 00:00:42,528
(Penny:)it kind of makes sense
that we actually live together.

18
00:00:42,525 --> 00:00:44,295
(Sheldon:)So that's all this day was?

19
00:00:44,293 --> 00:00:47,123
(Sheldon:)A plan to butter me up
before delivering bad news?

20
00:00:47,129 --> 00:00:49,129
(Leonard:)Come on, buddy.
No, I thought we were friends.

21
00:00:49,131 --> 00:00:51,401
(Sheldon:)You asked for a sip of my Icee.

22
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:54,470
(Sheldon:)If you had your own straw,
I might've said yes.

23
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:58,040
(Penny:)Sheldon, please, we already
feel bad about this.

24
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:00,010
(Sheldon:)You know what they don't sell
at The Container Store?

25
00:01:00,009 --> 00:01:02,609
(Sheldon:)Something large enough
to contain my disappointment.

26
00:01:04,513 --> 00:01:05,713
(Sheldon:)Although,

27
00:01:05,714 --> 00:01:08,684
(Sheldon:)if anyone did, it would be them.

28
00:01:08,684 --> 00:01:12,324
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

